  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): セイヨウナツユキソウ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%BB%E3%82%A4%E3%83%A8%E3%82%A6%E3%83%8A%E3%83%84%E3%83%A6%E3%82%AD%E3%82%BD%E3%82%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 106505550,
      "text": "セイヨウナツユキソウ（Filipendula ulmaria・日本語表記でフィリペンドゥラ・ウルマリア\n)は、バラ科シモツケソウ属の多年草。英名はメドウスイート(meadowsweet)。漢字では「西洋夏雪草」と書く。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Filipendula ulmaria",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filipendula_ulmaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1344915470,
      "text": "Filipendula ulmaria, commonly known as meadowsweet or mead wort, is a perennial herbaceous plant in the family Rosaceae that grows in damp meadows. It is native throughout most of Europe and Western Asia. It has been introduced and naturalised in North America."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Filipendula ulmaria",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filipendula_ulmaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 165962028,
      "text": "La ulmaria o reina de los prados es una especie de planta herbácea perteneciente a la familia de las rosáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Filipendula ulmaria",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filipendula_ulmaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 225536520,
      "text": "La Reine-des-prés, anciennement appelée ulmaire, ou fausse spirée, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Rosacées, originaire de l'Europe et d'Asie. C'est une plante mellifère."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Filipendula ulmaria",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filipendula_ulmaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 66739751,
      "text": "A ulmária, também conhecida por erva-ulmeira, rainha-dos-prados ou ulmeira, é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Rosaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Filipendula ulmaria",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Filipendula_ulmaria",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 28647387,
      "text": "Filipendula ulmaria, umumnya dikenal sebagai meadowsweet atau mead wort, adalah tanaman herba tahunan dalam famili Rosaceae yang tumbuh di padang rumput lembap. Spesies ini berasal dari Eropa hingga Timur Jauh Rusia Selatan dan Iran. Spesies ini merupakan tanaman tahunan dan tumbuh terutama di bioma beriklim sedang. Tanaman ini telah diperkenalkan dan dinaturalisasi di Amerika Utara."
    }
  },
